+# Transport Compression Codec
+
+This project has no current recorded decision on the transport compression codec: the decision config that once held a value for this was removed from the repository (commit bcee2d0, "move decision config out of the tree"), and no replacement record has been added since. Until a new decision is recorded, no codec should be assumed or implemented on its basis.
